        "Follow common-config-safety. Require isolated daemon Read/same-ID result/final marker; native-only --bare/--no-session-persistence is not daemon proof. Live independent Qwen/GPT settings are not production/default migration; aliases need separate checks. Roll back only registered independent settings on failure."
