        "Only for incorrect YAML, merge providers.<user-selected-id>.api=<user API base>, transport=chat_completions, default_model=<user-model>; set model.default=<user-model>, model.provider=<same provider-id>. Preserve other fields/credentials; never replace redacted YAML. Missing keys resolve to non-secret no-key-required only for explicitly unauthenticated loopback.",
